OL,3,GNEWSABaby squirrel monkey the latest
OL,4,Aaddition at zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby squirrel monkey is joining its
OL,7,Ffamily in one of the enclosures at a
OL,8,FTelford zoo.
OL,10,FThe new arrival, which was born at Hoo
OL,11,FZoo and Dinosaur World in the summer,
OL,12,Fis an addition to the troop of eight
OL,13,Fwhich were brought in from a zoo in
OL,14,FKent last year.
OL,16,FThe zoo's owner, Will Dorrell, said:
OL,17,F"It's always incredibly exciting when a
OL,18,Fnew arrival joins us, but we wanted to
OL,19,Fgive the baby time to grow and make
OL,20,Fsure everything was progressing well
OL,21,Fbefore announcing the news."
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
