OL,3,GNEWSABaby squirrel monkey the latest
OL,4,Aaddition at zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe zoo has not yet been able to
OL,7,Fdetermine the sex of the baby monkey,
OL,8,Fbut said visitors will spot it clinging
OL,9,Ftightly to family members.
